  "body": "Since the recent changes to the initial value of the image-orientation property, I have seen a couple of requests to expose the orientation metadata of the image directly, so that scripts can perform their own orientation processing.  This seems simple enough to do.  I will submit a PR shortly with an initial proposal.\r\n\r\n@stephenmcgruer @gyuyoung",
